{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111011422057-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111012124\"/><p>昨日(10日)晚上8時47分，西貢北港坳路一單位姓陳(62歲)女住戶報案，指上址一房間內有財物不翼而飛，懷疑遭爆竊。警員接報到場，經初步點算，相信失去兩隻共值約20萬港元的手錶及一對值約4.5萬港元的耳環。經初步調查，案件列「爆竊」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.850323+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:14:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:14.193946+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:20.787864+00:00","content_hash":"656f5099321f2745e5114c452958196ee916a93708296d1c32d004291e192648","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}